        "pwa/nuxel-apps/settings/manifest.json (owned by the Priority 2 / Priority 6 groups) declares no nuxel{} block yet, so nuxel.capabilities and nuxel.bridge_version are only recorded here. verify-app-registry.py reports this as a WARN (FAIL under --strict) until that manifest is completed by its owning group; the bridge_version recorded above is the pin value the PWA is built against."
