        "reason": "apps.js (NUXEL_REGISTRY_VERSION=4) lists org.nuxel.LiveConsole and its manifest shortcut, but pwa/nuxel-apps/console/ ships no index.html or manifest.json yet in this cycle. verify-app-registry.py reports this as DEFER, never as a silent pass, and --strict makes it fatal once every group has merged.",
        "expected": [
          "pwa/nuxel-apps/console/index.html",
          "pwa/nuxel-apps/console/manifest.json"
        ],
        "asserted_by": "tools/s10plus/a33/verify-app-registry.py"
